    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17137" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτολμ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄτολμος,</span>
			<i>be disheartened,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				6.7.3
			</span></i>: c.inf., <i>lack courage to</i> . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περαιτέρω προχωρῆσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					78.34
				</span></i>
			:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτολμ-όω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				<u>AB</u>
				407
			</span></i>(<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτολμάω</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, is incorrect).</div>
